msgstr "This page does not exist, or the item is no longer for sale."

#: templates/vitrine/introuvable.html:10
msgid ""
"Un commerçant peut retirer un article, ou suspendre sa boutique. Le lien "
"cesse alors de fonctionner — c'est voulu."
msgstr ""
"A trader can withdraw an item, or suspend their shop. The link then stops "
"working — that is intentional."

